                        "entry_id": "7cd95070-df9c-3165-b150-6cef8a463e63",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A brown clay, somewhat darker than ochre, which contains iron and manganese oxides."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5654389f-9d75-459f-bf0f-da0dc17b6912",
                                "sense_id": "c6708ef8-de12-3b9a-a60e-2620e8efb7ec",
                                "text": "I'll put myself in poor and mean attire,\nAnd with a kind of umber smirch my face;\nThe like do you; so shall we pass along,\nAnd never stir assailants."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "07af5cc5-617d-30c0-b377-b2fd2d79688a",
